<title>USA: American Portable Telecom, investors talk.</title>
<headline>American Portable Telecom, investors talk.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Portable Telecom Inc said Thursday it is in discussions with potential new investors.</p>
<p>The company said it continues to have discussions with a number of possible strategic partners, including Korea Telecom.  </p>
<p>No agreement has been reached with any potential investor.</p>
<p>American Portable Telecom has licenses to provice personal communications service in major trading areas covering 27.3 million of the U.S. population. It is a majority owned subsidiary of Telephone and Data Systems Inc.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
